# Integration Documentation

When adding or changing an integration, document it before finishing.

Documentation must include:

- objective and owner;
- required dependencies;
- required environment variables;
- setup steps;
- local validation steps;
- production/deploy considerations;
- troubleshooting;
- rollback or disable strategy when relevant.

Use existing docs when possible:

- Figma MCP: `docs/figma-mcp.md`
- Deploy/Vercel: `docs/deploy-vercel.md`
- Forms/leads or Calendly: create or update the closest relevant docs file.

Also update `.env.example` when a public or server environment variable is introduced.
